---
import { whatsappConfig, buildWhatsappUrl } from '../../config/whatsappMessages.js';
---
<section class="w-full pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-16 md:pb-28 bg-[#f7f7f5]">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
		<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-[#111] mb-4 text-center tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase">
			<span class="font-light text-black/55">Venta</span> <span class="text-[#a8763e] font-black">Mayorista</span> <span class="font-light text-black/55">vs</span> <span class="text-[#111] font-black">Minorista</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="text-lg md:text-2xl max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 text-black/55 font-semibold">
			Soluciones flexibles para tu negocio o tu hogar. ¡Aprovechá los mejores beneficios y atención personalizada!
		</p>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
			<!-- Card Mayorista -->
			<div class="business-card relative bg-white border border-[#a8763e]/50 shadow-xl shadow-[#a8763e]/10 rounded-sm p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#a8763e]/20 transition-all duration-300">
						   <div>
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-40 h-40 bg-orange-400/10 rounded-br-2xl rounded-tl-full opacity-40 -z-10"></div>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-orange-600 text-white p-2 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 1 0 20 10 10 0 0 1 0-20z"/><path d="M8 12h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-orange-500 leading-tight">Mayorista</h2>
						<p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 font-semibold">Para tu negocio</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 text-base mb-2 font-medium">Ideal para tiendas, gimnasios y dietéticas que buscan los mejores precios y condiciones del mercado.</p>
				<ul class="mb-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Compra en Volumen</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Pedidos desde 40 unidades con precios especiales</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Descuentos Exclusivos</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Hasta 40% de descuento en productos seleccionados</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3v18"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Márgenes Competitivos</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Mejores precios para maximizar tus ganancias</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M6 20v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Asesoría Personalizada</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Soporte dedicado para tu negocio</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="M8 16h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Envíos Programados</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Coordiná entregas según tu demanda</span></span></li>
				</ul>
		</div>
		<a href={buildWhatsappUrl(whatsappConfig.mayorista)} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-auto inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-orange-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl transition-all text-center shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl text-base mx-auto">Contactar</a>
			</div>
			<!-- Card Minorista -->
			<div class="business-card relative bg-white border border-black/20 shadow-xl shadow-black/10 rounded-sm p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						   <div>
				<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-40 h-40 bg-[#3d2314]/10 rounded-bl-2xl rounded-tr-full opacity-40 -z-10"></div>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5c4033] to-[#3d2314] text-white p-2 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 1 0 20 10 10 0 0 1 0-20z"/><path d="M16 12h-8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-[#3d2314] leading-tight">Minorista</h2>
						<p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 font-semibold">Para tu hogar</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 text-base mb-2 font-medium">Perfecto para vos que buscás calidad y comodidad en cada compra, con atención personalizada y promociones semanales.</p>
				<ul class="mb-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c4033]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M16 12h-8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Compra por Unidad</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Sin mínimos de compra, la cantidad que necesites</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c4033]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 19V5"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Entrega Rápida</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Envíos express en 24-48 horas</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c4033]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Variedad de Productos</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Amplio catálogo de suplementos y accesorios</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c4033]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 17h16"/><path d="M4 21h16"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Promociones Semanales</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Ofertas especiales cada semana</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c4033]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="M8 16h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Atención Personalizada</b> <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Consultas y soporte para tu compra</span></span></li>
				</ul>
		</div>
		<a href="/productos" class="mt-auto inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-[#5c4033] to-[#3d2314] hover:from-[#3d2314] hover:to-[#2a1810] text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl transition-all text-center shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl text-base mx-auto">Comprar Ahora</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.business-card.is-focused {
		transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
		border-color: #a8763e;
	}
</style>

<script>
	const businessCards = document.querySelectorAll('.business-card');
	businessCards.forEach((card) => {
		card.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => card.classList.add('is-focused'));
		card.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => card.classList.remove('is-focused'));
	});
</script>
